{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《<span style='font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\";'>2026</span>香港小姐競選決賽》昨日（<span style='font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\";'>30</span>）圓滿結束，<span style='font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\";'>2</span>號李澤欣成雙料季軍。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-31 下午3.19.34.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026S694Rt9bqJ1788165007.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-31 下午3.19.34.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">完成賽事後雙料季軍李澤欣接受<span style=\"color: rgb(220, 161, 13);\">tvb.com</span>獨家訪問，直言十分開心，奪得兩個獎項。</p><p style='text-align: left; margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\"; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 15px;'></p><p style='text-align: left; margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: \"PingFang HK\"; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;'>談到有網民對於其未能奪冠感可惜，她說：「我同大家道歉令大家失望，希望之後可以呈現到更好嘅自己畀大家。（滿意自己表現？）我覺得已經好滿足，同好享受成個舞台。」又指現時最想見到家人和吃東西。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">談到她最想感謝的人，李澤欣感觸地說：「我最想感謝我自己、台前幕後，因為佢哋畀咗好多支持同鼓勵我，同埋一路上嘅訓練都畀咗好多提點，令我一步步成為更好嘅自己。」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"batch_FR6D6884.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026w7OO9AXJNS1788165007.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"batch_FR6D6884.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-31T08:59:49.984620+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":258,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}